## platform, none in the registry, a tailnet grove (rc 3)
      └─ ✋ step 1 (reach) does not hold

  why: the registry reaches grove-demo over the tailnet and declares no platform for it
  fix:
    a box with no metadata cannot derive its own platform, so the first apply would
    halt at the derive. declare it in the registry, then re-run —
    rhx git.grove.set grove-demo --platform hetzner.hetzbot

  then run again from here —
    <fix>/bin/rhx git.grove.provision boot grove-demo --mode apply --from 1 --trust verified

